# ontosys cost catalog v0: what external operations cost, worst case first.
#
# Data, not vocabulary: every term is declared in code.ttl. One entry per
# (language, operation, receiver type). code:sizeOf says which size the cost
# grows with ("arg0", "arg1", "receiver", or "output" for the output written);
# code:iterates says the call runs a callback once per element of that size.
# JavaScript entries serve TypeScript and TSX. A repository may add entries and
# size caps in its own .ontosys/cost-catalog.ttl.

@prefix code: <https://ontosys.io/ns/code#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

<https://ontosys.io/ns/code/cost-catalog> owl:versionInfo "v0 2026-11-09" .

